{"data":{"body":"**P2:** When the provider is visible but its `DurableSampler` comes from the agent class loader, this falls back to the system-property carrier. The sampling result was already resolved, but that carrier preserves only its decision enum, so custom sampler attributes and updated trace state are lost from `DurableExecutionRoot`. Defer resolution to the foreign `DurableSampler` or bridge the complete `SamplingResult`, and add a direct-foreign test asserting attributes and trace state.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77SFb5","finding_digest":"e0cdf981d1d13336bdc19f08823ccb4c3eab00f17d4c51a50b201665365116b3","finding_id":"arf_v1_4dg7taor2eztnpobt4eiepgljq","finding_key":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::foreign-sampler-result-fidelity","identity_key":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::foreign-sampler-result-fidelity","line":46,"observation_digest":"523d32ba8ffdb5f79587ddb0eb40ab2b900c1eaff2d62f4d10c484775758e164","observation_id":"aro_v1_ki6tfoup7w27pfmh3wyowqflfo","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginSupport.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_4dg7taor2eztnpobt4eiepgljq","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:39Z","review_id":"arr_v1_54b35mmyfjjrvc5g2237mvutxm","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"ef2c0fe0075e6f38ffc899114460bd7d4a976d63","reviewer":"codex","start_line":46,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_raxre5cp3fqt4ayp25gxoehpip","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:39Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
